--- !u!114 &291234042
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 291234041}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5c6f0d7c81fa12d4792dfc8902b25f60, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneLoader: {fileID: 175818256}
  nextSceneToLoad: Scene_TruongHoc_Dem1
  startOnAwake: 1
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: Come in and lock the door behind you.
    vietnameseLine: "V\xE0o \u0111i v\xE0 kh\xF3a c\u1EEDa l\u1EA1i."
  - speakerName: EUA
    englishLine: '"I lock the door"'
    vietnameseLine: "T\xF4i kh\xF3a c\u1EEDa l\u1EA1i"
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: EUA, correct? Thank you for coming on such short notice. Please,
      sit.
    vietnameseLine: "EUA, \u0111\xFAng kh\xF4ng? C\u1EA3m \u01A1n v\xEC \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA5p. M\u1EDDi ng\u1ED3i."
  - speakerName: EUA
    englishLine: Thank you for seeing me, sir. The ad said you needed a night guard
      immediately.
    vietnameseLine: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n \xF4ng \u0111\xE3 g\u1EB7p t\xF4i, th\u01B0a
      \xF4ng. Qu\u1EA3ng c\xE1o n\xF3i r\u1EB1ng \xF4ng c\u1EA7n b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7
      ca \u0111\xEAm ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c."
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: We do. We do. This old school... she has a lot of history. And a
      lot of... valuable equipment. We need someone reliable. Your resume is... well,
      it shows you're really need a job.
    vietnameseLine: "\u0110\xFAng v\u1EADy. R\u1EA5t c\u1EA7n. Ng\xF4i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      c\u0169 n\xE0y... n\xF3 c\xF3 r\u1EA5t nhi\u1EC1u l\u1ECBch s\u1EED. V\xE0
      r\u1EA5t nhi\u1EC1u... thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      c\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE1ng tin c\u1EADy. H\u1ED3 s\u01A1
      c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu... \u1EEBm, n\xF3 cho th\u1EA5y c\u1EADu \u0111ang r\u1EA5t
      c\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c."
  - speakerName: EUA
    englishLine: I'm a hard worker, sir. I'm just... between jobs.
    vietnameseLine: "T\xF4i l\xE0m vi\u1EC7c r\u1EA5t ch\u0103m ch\u1EC9, th\u01B0a
      \xF4ng. T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 \u0111ang... trong l\xFAc ch\u1EDD vi\u1EC7c."
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: '"Between jobs." Yes. The last guard... well, he found the solitude...
      difficult. He left very suddenly.'
    vietnameseLine: "\"Ch\u1EDD vi\u1EC7c.\" Ph\u1EA3i. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA3o
      v\u1EC7 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc... \u1EEBm, anh ta th\u1EA5y c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c n\xE0y...
      qu\xE1 c\xF4 \u0111\u01A1n. Anh ta \u0111\xE3 ngh\u1EC9 vi\u1EC7c r\u1EA5t
      \u0111\u1ED9t ng\u1ED9t."
  - speakerName: EUA
    englishLine: Solitude isn't a problem for me. I just need the work.
    vietnameseLine: "S\u1EF1 c\xF4 \u0111\u01A1n kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 v\u1EA5n
      \u0111\u1EC1 v\u1EDBi t\xF4i. T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c."
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: Excellent. That's what I needed to hear. The job is simple. You
      stay in the security office. You watch the monitors. You do your rounds at
      1 AM and 4 AM.
    vietnameseLine: "Tuy\u1EC7t v\u1EDDi. \u0110\xF3 l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u t\xF4i
      c\u1EA7n nghe. C\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c r\u1EA5t \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n. C\u1EADu
      \u1EDF trong ph\xF2ng b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7. C\u1EADu xem camera. C\u1EADu \u0111i
      tu\u1EA7n l\xFAc 1 gi\u1EDD s\xE1ng v\xE0 4 gi\u1EDD s\xE1ng."
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: There is one very important rule. The West Wing is permanently off-limits.
      Structural issues. You understand?
    vietnameseLine: "C\xF3 m\u1ED9t quy t\u1EAFc r\u1EA5t quan tr\u1ECDng. D\xE3y
      T\xE2y b\u1ECB c\u1EA5m v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n. V\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 v\u1EC1
      k\u1EBFt c\u1EA5u. C\u1EADu hi\u1EC3u ch\u1EE9?"
  - speakerName: EUA
    englishLine: The West Wing. Got it.
    vietnameseLine: "D\xE3y ph\xEDa T\xE2y. R\xF5 r\u1ED3i."
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: Good. Your only job is to ensure the building is secure from the
      outside. Do not concern yourself with... noises. Old buildings make noise.
    vietnameseLine: "T\u1ED1t. C\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c duy nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu
      l\xE0 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o t\xF2a nh\xE0 an to\xE0n t\u1EEB b\xEAn ngo\xE0i.
      \u0110\u1EEBng b\u1EADn t\xE2m \u0111\u1EBFn... nh\u1EEFng ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng.
      Nh\u1EEFng t\xF2a nh\xE0 c\u0169 th\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\xE1t ra ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng."
  - speakerName: EUA
    englishLine: Noises?
    vietnameseLine: "Ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng?"
  - speakerName: PRINCIPAL ERIKA
    englishLine: Just the pipes, EUA. Don't let your imagination run wild. You start
      tonight. There's a training video, a VHS tape, in the security office. Watch
      it. It will tell you everything you need to know.
    vietnameseLine: "Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 \u1ED1ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc th\xF4i, EUA. \u0110\u1EEBng
      \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xED t\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu bay xa.
      C\u1EADu b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1ED1i nay. C\xF3 m\u1ED9t cu\u1ED9n b\u0103ng
      video h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn, b\u0103ng VHS, trong ph\xF2ng b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7.
      H\xE3y xem n\xF3. N\xF3 s\u1EBD cho c\u1EADu bi\u1EBFt m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 c\u1EADu
      c\u1EA7n."
